<td id="S5.T2.fig1.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T2.fig1.1.6.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">72.1%</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S5.T2.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:178.9pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 2: </span>Performance on Single Shapes.</figcaption>
